{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The runtime is in the proposal phase: I can prepare model code and a study plan, while the host handles training and scoring. The latest coarse-order model reached validation click AUC 0.66501; its matched duplicate-information control reached 0.66322. That single-seed result supports a follow-up, but it does not establish the mechanism.\n\nI’ll test a specific remaining limitation: the current linear order summaries cannot distinguish histories with different middle-versus-end patterns when their means and linear moments agree.\n"}}
